[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339085784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110928#issuecomment-3339085784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110928","id":3339085784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HBmfY","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T15:03:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T15:03:48Z","body":"I replicated it!! you just need to add `@tool` at the start of `enum_state_parent.gd` in the MRP, then reload the project, or close and reopen the `example_scene.tscn`.\n\nSo it looks like it is related to being run in the editor. The enum may not be parsed in time?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339085784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341296175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110928#issuecomment-3341296175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110928","id":3341296175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HKCIv","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T06:15:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T06:39:18Z","body":"A workaround, declare `@export` onto `current_state` of `enum_child.gd`.\n\n```\n@export var current_state:ThreeStateSwitch.State = State.SLEEPING:\n\tset = set_state\n```\n\nI guess, the problem is:\n\n- When using `@tool` annotation, script will create `script_instance` using `PlaceHolderScriptInstance`\n- `PlaceHolderScriptInstance` using `member_default_values_cache` determine property `set` success\n- `member_default_values_cache` using `export` determine if variable has default value\n- when editor invoke `update_exports()` to refresh export variables, it invoke the `ready() function` to update variable of a `non-tool` class, then error occur\n\nTo confirm this guess: define a float typed variable, current_text2, update `switch.current_text` when `ready`, the error occur. So the problem is not relevant with enum, but all the types without `@export`.\n\n```\n@export var current_text2 := 8.0\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tswitch.current_state = current_state2\n\tswitch.current_text = current_text2\n\n  ERROR: res://enum_bug/enum_state_parent.gd:17 - Invalid assignment of property or key 'current_text' with value of type 'float' on a base object of type 'Node3D (ThreeStateSwitch)'.1222\n\n```\n\nBecause of `PlaceHolderScriptInstance`, `@tool` annotated class cannot work with non-`@tool` annotated classes.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341296175/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341459864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110928#issuecomment-3341459864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110928","id":3341459864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HKqGY","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T09:53:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T09:53:35Z","body":"Nice catch!\n\nSo I guess this is not a Godot bug, it is just that I need to use:\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready():\n    if not Engine.is_editor_hint():\n        switch.current_state = current_state\n\n```\nbecause `switch` is not a tool and won't support this assignment while `_ready` is being called whenever the scene is opened in the editor.\n\nIf we are happy that this is not a bug, I can close this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341459864/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]